6200 REM ===== BASIC SELECTION SORT =====
6210 REM ponytail: 100-row O(n^2) sort is deliberate; replace only if the dataset grows materially.
6220 FOR I = 1 TO RecordCount - 1
6230 FOR J = I + 1 TO RecordCount
6240 A = ORD(I): B = ORD(J): SwapFlag = 0
6250 IF SortMode = 1 AND RK(A) > RK(B) THEN SwapFlag = 1
6260 IF SortMode = 2 AND MVAL(A) < MVAL(B) THEN SwapFlag = 1
6270 IF SortMode = 3 AND MVAL(A) > MVAL(B) THEN SwapFlag = 1
